section_block.the_magic_of_food=THE MAGIC OF FOOD
section_block.the_magic_of_food.description=Food is an experience that transcends the moment. It does not begin on the plate nor end with the last bite. It lives in what brings us together, in what we inherit, and in what we transform. \nEvery gathering around a table is also a meeting of stories, places, and memories. Nothing remains the same: everything blends, evolves, and takes on new meaning. \nPerhaps that is why dining is a way of traveling without leaving, of rediscovering the familiar through a new perspective, and of uncovering what we did not yet know we were seeking.\nBecause in the end, we do not only remember what we ate, but what we felt while living it.

section_block.the_experience=THE KINTUCHAY EXPERIENCE
section_block.the_experience.description=Discover a place where Peruvian cuisine, mixology, and the magic of Cusco come together in one space. \nEnjoy the finest of our national gastronomy, prepared with flavors and ingredients that embody the richness of Peru, accompanied by a curated selection of cocktails—both timeless classics and creations designed to surprise. \nAll of this unfolds in an incomparable setting: a unique vantage point to admire the great city of Cusco in all its splendor. Let yourself be captivated by breathtaking views of the city, its rooftops, mountains, and sunsets, while sharing a memorable meal and an exceptional drink.

